function card(p){const pizza=isPizza(p),pasta=isPasta(p),fries=isFries(p),sized=hasSizeOptions(p),prices=pizza?pizzaPrices(p):(pasta?pastaPrices(p):fries?friesPrices(p):null);const sizeButtons=pizza?[['small','Small',prices.small],['medium','Medium',prices.medium],['large','Large',prices.large]]:(pasta||fries)?[['full','Full',prices.full],['half','Half',prices.half]]:[];return `<article class="product-card${sized?' size-product-card':''}${pizza?' pizza-product-card':''}"><div class="product-image"><img src="${esc(p.image||pics[p.category]||pics.burger)}" alt="${esc(p.name)}" loading="lazy" onerror="this.src='${pics.burger}'"><span class="product-tag">${esc(p.category).toUpperCase()}</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>${esc(p.name)}</h3><p>${esc(p.description||'Made fresh for you.')}</p>${sizeButtons.length?`<div class="menu-size-buttons ${pasta||fries?'pasta-size-buttons':'pizza-size-buttons'}">${sizeButtons.map(([key,label,price])=>`<button type="button" data-size-add="${esc(p.id)}" data-size="${key}" class="${selectedSizes.get(p.id)===key?'selected':''}" aria-pressed="${selectedSizes.get(p.id)===key?'true':'false'}" ${price<=0?'disabled':''}><span>${label}</span><b>${price>0?money(price):'Price not set'}</b></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="product-bottom"><b class="product-price">${sized?'Choose size':money(p.price)+(p.category==='dahi'?' / kg':'')}</b><button class="add-btn" data-add="${esc(p.id)}" aria-label="Add selected size of ${esc(p.name)} to cart">+</button></div></div></article>`}
function bottleNavCard(p){return `<article class="product-card bottle-nav-card"><div class="product-image"><img src="${esc(p.image||pics.drinks)}" alt="${esc(p.name)}" loading="lazy" onerror="this.src='${pics.drinks}'"><span class="product-tag">DRINKS</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>${esc(p.name)}</h3><p>${esc(p.description||'Explore our cold drinks.')}</p><div class="product-bottom"><b class="product-price">View drinks menu</b><button class="add-btn" type="button" data-open-drinks aria-label="Open Drinks menu">+</button></div></div></article>`}
function renderProducts(target,section,cat,q=''){const placement=section==='fastfood'?(cat==='pizza-all'?'pizza-all':cat==='all'?'fastfood-all':cat):'';let a=state.products.filter(p=>p.active!==false&&p.section===section&&((cat==='pizza-all'||cat==='pizza')?(p.showInCategory!==false&&['pizza','pizza-all','regular-pizza','special-pizza','stuffed-pizza'].includes((p.publicCategory&&p.publicCategory!=='category'&&p.publicCategory!=='all')?p.publicCategory:p.category)):cat==='all'?p.showInSectionAll!==false:(p.showInCategory!==false&&((p.publicCategory&&p.publicCategory!=='category'&&p.publicCategory!=='all')?p.publicCategory:p.category)===cat))&&(`${p.name} ${p.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())));let extras=[];if(placement){extras=state.products.filter(p=>p.active!==false&&p.section==='drinks'&&(p.displayLocations||[]).includes(placement)&&(`${p.name} ${p.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())))}let ordered=a;if(section==='fastfood'&&cat==='all'){ordered=[...a.filter(p=>!hasSizeOptions(p)),...a.filter(p=>hasSizeOptions(p)&&!isPizza(p)),...a.filter(p=>isPizza(p))]}const html=section==='fastfood'&&cat==='all'?[...ordered.filter(p=>!isPizza(p)).map(card),...extras.map(bottleNavCard),...ordered.filter(p=>isPizza(p)).map(card)]:[...ordered.map(card),...extras.map(bottleNavCard)];$(target).innerHTML=html.length?html.join(''):'<p style="grid-column:1/-1;color:#777">No products found. Try another category.</p>';return html.length}
function homeProductCard(p){return `<article class="product-card home-product" role="link" tabindex="0" data-home-section="${esc(p.section)}" data-home-category="${esc(p.category)}" aria-label="Explore ${esc(p.name)} menu"><div class="product-image"><img src="${esc(p.image||pics[p.category]||pics.burger)}" alt="${esc(p.name)}" loading="lazy"><span class="product-tag">EXPLORE MENU ↗</span></div><div class="product-info"><h3>${esc(p.name)}</h3><p>${esc(p.description||'Made fresh for you.')}</p><div class="product-bottom"><b class="product-price">${money(p.price)}${p.category==='dahi'?' / kg':''}</b><span class="home-go">View menu ↗</span></div></div></article>`}function renderHomeProducts(){let featured=state.products.filter(p=>p.active!==false&&p.featured!==false);featured=[...featured.filter(p=>!isPizza(p)),...featured.filter(p=>isPizza(p))];$('#homeProducts').innerHTML=featured.map(homeProductCard).join('')||'<p>No featured products available yet. Add products from Admin Panel and select Feature on Home page.</p>'}function renderHomeDeals(){$('#homeDeals').innerHTML=state.deals.filter(d=>d.active!==false&&(d.featured!==false||d.section==='all')).slice(0,2).map(d=>{let p=state.products.find(x=>(d.productIds||[]).includes(x.id));return `<a href="#deals" class="deal-card home-deal"><div class="deal-copy"><span class="deal-label">★ SPECIAL DEAL</span><h3>${esc(d.name)}</h3><p>${esc(d.description||'A delicious deal made for sharing.')}</p><div class="deal-price">${money(d.price)}</div><span class="btn primary">View deal ↗</span></div><img src="${esc(d.image||(p&&(p.image||pics[p.category])||pics.burger))}" alt="${esc(d.name)}" loading="lazy"></a>`}).join('')||'<p>New deals coming soon.</p>'}
